    "theory": "Fashion classification introduces complex intra-class variance (e.g. diverse shoe silhouettes or baggy trousers). An MLP with L2 regularization (`alpha=0.01`) penalizes large weight norms $||W||_2^2$, preventing the network from memorizing individual noise pixels.",
