    "theory": "Histogram of Oriented Gradients (HOG) decomposes image patches into a grid of cells, accumulating 1-D histograms of gradient directions $\\theta = \\arctan(G_y / G_x)$. Normalizing across overlapping blocks provides robust illumination invariance.",
